    "Vital/lab values and diagnoses were randomized independently when the dataset was generated; there is no causal signal beyond surface position/context patterns.",
    "Single seeded run, no cross-validation; vocabulary is tiny (Phase 4 vocab of ~229 tokens) and English-only.",
